{"3994690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alpine Skater", "steam_appid": 3994690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alpine Skater</strong> takes mountain skating to the next level with tracks that span every kind of terrain the highlands can offer. From icy slopes and snow-dusted ridges to rugged rocky paths and many more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-12 Different challenges available in the game. Each mountain environment has its own physics, surface feel, and hazards, keeping the gameplay exciting and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Various different skaters available in the game and master unique tricks as you progress through diverse mountain regions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-With stunning scenery, dynamic challenges, and endless replayability, <i>Alpine Skater</i> is your ultimate ride across various different mountain tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Ride the Peaks, Master the Slopes.”</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alpine Skater</strong> takes mountain skating to the next level with tracks that span every kind of terrain the highlands can offer. From icy slopes and snow-dusted ridges to rugged rocky paths and many more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-12 Different challenges available in the game. Each mountain environment has its own physics, surface feel, and hazards, keeping the gameplay exciting and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Various different skaters available in the game and master unique tricks as you progress through diverse mountain regions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-With stunning scenery, dynamic challenges, and endless replayability, <i>Alpine Skater</i> is your ultimate ride across various different mountain tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Ride the Peaks, Master the Slopes.”</p>", "short_descriptio